# Client state of sys-corpse-state: the 1.14d client unit sets (traces/pc1/client-state/sys-corpse-state.cstate.jsonl, state-snapshot.md section 3 rule 5) against the ClientWorld of d2-client (state-dump --client-out); same save, seed, pokes and input as sys-corpse-state.
# Census: death and the player's corpse on the state channel (combat/vitals.md
# §4.7-§4.8): hitpoints to zero at frame 10, 200 ticks idle through the death
# animation, the corpse unit and the respawn timer.
name cs-sys-corpse-state
